---
source: core/src/orchestrator.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Re-embed ALL persisted L2 memory vectors with the live primary embedding model. Use when the user has approved the model-change consent alert (or asks you to 'reembed all memory' / '重新计算所有 embedding' / 'rebuild vectors'). The call will (1) set every `l2_experience.embedding` and `l2_ephemeral.embedding` to NULL, (2) re-embed each fact sequentially via the current primary model (~10 req/sec), (3) persist the new vectors, (4) request an HNSW rebuild, (5) update the `embedding_corpus_model` marker. Response fields: status, rows_cleared, rows_reembedded, rows_failed, walltime_sec, model_used. Destructive — requires human approval. Only one reembed may run at a time (second call returns status='already_in_progress')."
name: trigger_corpus_reembed
parameters:
  additionalProperties: false
  properties:
    scope:
      description: "Reembed scope. 'all' (MVP) recomputes every L2 vector in the corpus. 'since_date' is reserved for a future incremental pass and currently returns not_implemented. Default 'all'."
      enum:
        - all
        - since_date
      type: string
  type: object
